sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Requester
  participant W as Worker
  participant C as Chain
  participant A as Auditor
  participant X as Watcher
  participant DA as DA Layer
  participant V as Consensus
  U->>C: createTask(C_T)
  C->>W: assign task
  W->>W: ExecuteOnce(model, x)
  W->>W: Build R_X + R_E + C_A
  W->>C: commitResponse(C_R)
  C-->>C: finalize commitment
  C->>C: derive eta from epoch beacon
  C->>A: publish audit seed/obligations
  A->>W: request selected openings
  W-->>A: trace/IEC openings
  A->>C: audit result
  W->>DA: publish coded artifact
  DA->>C: availability certificate
  X->>C: optional challenge
  C->>C: dispute / bisection / slash
  C->>C: receipt matures
  C->>V: next-epoch PoI weight
